WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
Three more Latin bases.

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:06.030
Rupt means break, so to interrupt is to break in.

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:11.350
Duct and duce mean lead, so an aqueduct leads water across a valley.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:16.400
Form means shape, so a formation is a shape made by many people.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.880
Find the base.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.140
It carries the meaning.
